<title>USA: NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF ALL-NBA FIRST, SECOND AND THIRD TEAMS.</title>
<headline>NBA BASKETBALL-LIST OF ALL-NBA FIRST, SECOND AND THIRD TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>List of players voted to the</p>
<p>All-NBA First, Second and Third teams as announced by the</p>
<p>National Basketball Association on Wednesday:</p>
<p>All-NBA First Team</p>
<p> Forward  Karl Malone, Utah (115 first Team votes)  575 points</p>
<p> Forward  Grant Hill, Detroit (76)			483</p>
<p> Centre   Hakeem Olajuwon, Houston (89)		 514</p>
<p> Guard    Michael Jordan, Chicago (115)		 575</p>
<p> Guard    Tim Hardaway, Miami (62)			435</p>
<p>All-NBA Second Team</p>
<p> Forward  Scottie Pippen, Chicago (19)		  337</p>
<p> Forward  Glen Rice, Charlotte (20)		     316</p>
<p> Centre   Patrick Ewing, New York (20)		  327</p>
<p> Guard    Gary Payton, Seattle (42)		     386</p>
<p> Guard    Mitch Richmond, Sacramento (1)		198</p>
<p>All-NBA Third Team</p>
<p> Forward  Anthony Mason, Charlotte			110</p>
<p> Forward  Vin Baker, Milwaukee			     61</p>
<p> Centre   Shaquille O'Neal, LA Lakers (3)		72</p>
<p> Guard    John Stockton, Utah (6)			 142</p>
<p> Guard    Anfernee Hardaway, Orlando (2)		 62</p>
</text>
